[Notes.DisclaimerNormal_AbstrInv DisAbstractItem]
m_ItemName="Oil Drop"
m_PluralItemName=""
m_Description="Shoot as many falling Whale Oil Tanks as possible.\n \nYou have a fully upgraded pistol with unlimited ammo.\n\nScoring: \n* Each tank destroyed raises your score.\n* You earn a score bonus if you destroy several tanks at the same time. \n* You earn a score bonus if you don't miss a single tank.\n* You earn a score bonus for good accuracy.\n\nSpecial:\nThere are several types of Whale Oil Tanks:\n* Regular Tank\n* Purple Tank: creates a cloud of smoke when shot\n* Gold Tank: slows time down for 2 seconds\n* Green Tank: enables Dark Vision for 15 seconds\n* Pink Tank: restores 35% of your health\n \nGame Over: \nThe game is over if you die."

